    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B05b scope (harness admin)","items":["Part of B05-agent-workflow split. Module: harness-admin (29 routes, 1 controller) under /admin/harness.","Policy/audit: GET/PATCH policy, GET/PATCH policy/global, GET audit. Eval/golden sets: eval-runs list/get, golden-sets CRUD-like endpoints, cases, run, promote-to-golden-set flows.","Gate/edit: gate-queue, edit-burden, gate-edit-exemplars list/export/curation/promote. Workflows/live: workflows list/get/cancel/terminate/signal, live sessions/capabilities/config read+patch."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Policy: GET /admin/harness/policy or /policy/global -> effective policy; PATCH accepts policy updates -> updated policy (global/tenant scope per handler).","Golden set run: POST /admin/harness/golden-sets/:id/run -> eval run/result metadata. Exemplar curation/promote: PATCH curation or POST promote-to-golden-set -> updated exemplar/promotion result.","Workflow control: POST /admin/harness/workflows/:id/cancel|terminate|signal -> control operation result (action confirmation/reason policies may apply). Live config: GET/PATCH /admin/harness/live/config -> live documentation config/state.","Verify exact DTO schemas, RBAC/authorize scopes, and confirmation/audit behavior for destructive workflow operations."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence and limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. HarnessAdminController and key service sources verified in local tree.","Controller dependencies include HarnessPolicyService, HarnessObservabilityService, HarnessOpsClient, LiveDocumentationService, EvalService, GateEditMiningService, EvalRunService, GoldenCasePromotionService (+ optional confirmation/event services).","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes (29 routes in 1 controller); HarnessOpsClient location/runtime topology summarized as external ops; exact route DTOs, scopes, and workflow-engine integration should be reconciled with OpenAPI/implementation."]}
